      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Channel of Queues carry\nmessages.\n- Channels are placed inside an\nintermediary called broker.\nproducer produces, consumer\nconsumes\n- Messages in a channel are\n\"DESTRUCTIVE READ\"",
      "fontSize": 15.652711102141177,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "7b_VdPbfefR5nR8oynOI3",
      "originalText": "- Channel of Queues carry messages.\n- Channels are placed inside an intermediary called broker. producer produces, consumer consumes\n- Messages in a channel are \"DESTRUCTIVE READ\"",
      "autoResize": true,
