      "text": "- Corba/IDL (old)\n- SOA- SOAP\n- REST (current)\n- GRPC\n- GRAPHQL\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 21.913795542997647,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Corba/IDL (old)\n- SOA- SOAP\n- REST (current)\n- GRPC\n- GRAPHQL\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
