      "seed": 1276473432,
      "version": 670,
      "versionNonce": 1042815832,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773245101259,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Dumb Broker & Smart Clients\n- Not a Destructive Read, Rewind & Play\n- Has Configurable durability, cCloud has infinite storage\nSummarize:\n   - From Smart pipes to Dump pipes\n   - From Transient to Durable\n   - Point to Point to Event Streaming",
      "fontSize": 21.913795542997647,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Dumb Broker & Smart Clients\n- Not a Destructive Read, Rewind & Play\n- Has Configurable durability, cCloud has infinite storage\nSummarize:\n   - From Smart pipes to Dump pipes\n   - From Transient to Durable\n   - Point to Point to Event Streaming",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JLplyuKP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1713.1196116812594,
      "y": -100.06957937347488,
      "width": 1061.3076881828604,
      "height": 444.2024529111252,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b33",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1901462312,
      "version": 509,
      "versionNonce": 1658945064,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773245089238,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "=========================================================================================\nTHE \"V\"        | DESCRIPTION                      | HADOOP ERA IMPACT | STREAMING IMPACT\n=========================================================================================\n1. VOLUME      | Amount of data (PB/EB).          | High (Storage)    | High (Throughput)\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n2. VELOCITY    | Speed of data generation.        | Low (Batch)       | Highest (Real-time)\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n3. VARIETY     | Diverse formats (Video, IoT).    | Schema-on-Read    | Multi-modal AI\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n4. VERACITY    | Truthfulness/Quality of data.    | Post-processing   | In-flight Cleaning\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n5. VALUE       | Business usefulness.             | Historical        | Predictive\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n6. VARIABILITY | Changes in data meaning/flow.    | Manual updates    | Automated Scaling\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n7. VISUALIZAT. | Ability to see/interpret data.   | Static Reports    | Live Dashboards\n=========================================================================================",
      "fontSize": 20.90364484287648,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "=========================================================================================\nTHE \"V\"        | DESCRIPTION                      | HADOOP ERA IMPACT | STREAMING IMPACT\n=========================================================================================\n1. VOLUME      | Amount of data (PB/EB).          | High (Storage)    | High (Throughput)\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n2. VELOCITY    | Speed of data generation.        | Low (Batch)       | Highest (Real-time)\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n3. VARIETY     | Diverse formats (Video, IoT).    | Schema-on-Read    | Multi-modal AI\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n4. VERACITY    | Truthfulness/Quality of data.    | Post-processing   | In-flight Cleaning\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n5. VALUE       | Business usefulness.             | Historical        | Predictive\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n6. VARIABILITY | Changes in data meaning/flow.    | Manual updates    | Automated Scaling\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n7. VISUALIZAT. | Ability to see/interpret data.   | Static Reports    | Live Dashboards\n=========================================================================================",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bTZ3iyOo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1711.8887439580449,
      "y": -148.42074983572343,
      "width": 418.10418701171875,
      "height": 26.1295560535956,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b34",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1541544024,
      "version": 210,
      "versionNonce": 2036300072,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773245089238,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The Evolution of the \"Vs\" (2003–2026)",
      "fontSize": 20.90364484287648,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The Evolution of the \"Vs\" (2003–2026)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "M7YKzGJ6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2955.1915563543653,
      "y": -111.0980486714293,
      "width": 1256.2284364123898,
      "height": 339.6842286967428,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1697127000,
      "version": 384,
      "versionNonce": 610669608,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773245089238,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "=========================================================================================\nCORE CONCEPT      | THE \"HADOOP\" WAY (2010)          | THE \"STREAMING\" WAY (2026)\n=========================================================================================\nPrimary \"V\" Focus | Volume (Store everything).       | Velocity (Act on everything).\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nData State        | Data at Rest (Files on Disk).    | Data in Motion (Event Streams).\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nQuality Control   | Weekly data \"cleansing\" jobs.    | Real-time Schema Validation.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInfrastructure    | Static Clusters (HDFS/YARN).     | Serverless/Cloud-Native (K8s).\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBusiness Value    | Reactive (What happened?).       | Proactive (What is happening?).\n=========================================================================================",
      "fontSize": 20.90364484287648,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "=========================================================================================\nCORE CONCEPT      | THE \"HADOOP\" WAY (2010)          | THE \"STREAMING\" WAY (2026)\n=========================================================================================\nPrimary \"V\" Focus | Volume (Store everything).       | Velocity (Act on everything).\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nData State        | Data at Rest (Files on Disk).    | Data in Motion (Event Streams).\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nQuality Control   | Weekly data \"cleansing\" jobs.    | Real-time Schema Validation.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInfrastructure    | Static Clusters (HDFS/YARN).     | Serverless/Cloud-Native (K8s).\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBusiness Value    | Reactive (What happened?).       | Proactive (What is happening?).\n=========================================================================================",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
