      "text": "Hadoop Created By\n  - from Google papers : Doug Cutting & Mike Cafarella",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hadoop Created By\n  - from Google papers : Doug Cutting & Mike Cafarella",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iB0tbAMN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4161.191325097437,
      "y": -687.837969303209,
      "width": 1040.301681245985,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1835976280,
      "version": 142,
      "versionNonce": 894277208,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773245818049,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "=========================================================================================\nTRANSFORMATION     | FROM (OLD WORLD)                 | TO (NEW WORLD)\n=========================================================================================\nScaling Model      | Vertical (Buy a bigger box).     | Horizontal (Add more boxes).\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHardware           | Expensive, Proprietary Servers.  | Cheap, Commodity Cloud VMs.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nProcessing         | Batch (Wait until midnight).     | Real-time (Process as it arrives).\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nData Schema        | Schema-on-Write (Strict SQL).    | Schema-on-Read (Flexible NoSQL).\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIntegration        | Point-to-Point (EIP).            | Event-Driven (Streaming Mesh).\n=========================================================================================",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "=========================================================================================\nTRANSFORMATION     | FROM (OLD WORLD)                 | TO (NEW WORLD)\n=========================================================================================\nScaling Model      | Vertical (Buy a bigger box).     | Horizontal (Add more boxes).\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHardware           | Expensive, Proprietary Servers.  | Cheap, Commodity Cloud VMs.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nProcessing         | Batch (Wait until midnight).     | Real-time (Process as it arrives).\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nData Schema        | Schema-on-Write (Strict SQL).    | Schema-on-Read (Flexible NoSQL).\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIntegration        | Point-to-Point (EIP).            | Event-Driven (Streaming Mesh).\n=========================================================================================",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OdFyjsVs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1713.7306973915015,
      "y": 435.7888528235178,
      "width": 1218.4556843828668,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2111657512,
      "version": 126,
      "versionNonce": 1901246040,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773246131107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "=========================================================================================\nSTRATEGY          | DATA SHIPPING (OLD)      | DATA LOCALITY (HADOOP)   | DATA-FLOW (STREAM)\n=========================================================================================\nThe Flow          | Data moves to Code.      | Code moves to Data.      | Data flows thru Code.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPrimary Resource  | Network Bandwidth.       | Local Disk I/O.          | In-Memory State/RAM.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nExecution Type    | Request-Response.        | Scheduled Batch Jobs.    | Continuous/Forever.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nData State        | Transient in RAM.        | Persistent on Disk.      | Stateful in Memory.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nLatency Goal      | Human Speed (Secs).      | Process Speed (Hours).   | Event Speed (ms).\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nScaling Trigger   | User requests.           | Data Volume growth.      | Event Velocity.\n=========================================================================================",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "=========================================================================================\nSTRATEGY          | DATA SHIPPING (OLD)      | DATA LOCALITY (HADOOP)   | DATA-FLOW (STREAM)\n=========================================================================================\nThe Flow          | Data moves to Code.      | Code moves to Data.      | Data flows thru Code.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPrimary Resource  | Network Bandwidth.       | Local Disk I/O.          | In-Memory State/RAM.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nExecution Type    | Request-Response.        | Scheduled Batch Jobs.    | Continuous/Forever.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nData State        | Transient in RAM.        | Persistent on Disk.      | Stateful in Memory.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nLatency Goal      | Human Speed (Secs).      | Process Speed (Hours).   | Event Speed (ms).\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nScaling Trigger   | User requests.           | Data Volume growth.      | Event Velocity.\n=========================================================================================",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
