      "seed": 1037535070,
      "version": 431,
      "versionNonce": 841567426,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781461893256,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Monoid\n\nA monoid is an algebraic structure consisting of:\n\n\nA set (S): Collection of values\nA binary operation (⊕): How to combine two\nelements\nAn identity element (e): A neutral value\n\n\nNotation: Monoid = {Set, Operation, Identity}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "haVM9P-fL5mDeFrMGQkom",
      "originalText": "Monoid\n\nA monoid is an algebraic structure consisting of:\n\n\nA set (S): Collection of values\nA binary operation (⊕): How to combine two elements\nAn identity element (e): A neutral value\n\n\nNotation: Monoid = {Set, Operation, Identity}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
