      "text": "- Fold or reduce applies an operation cumulatively over\na sequence. \nSomething like:\nSignature: fold(initial_value, operation, sequence)\n\nReturns: The accumulated result after applying\noperation to all elements\n\nSame operation applied incrementally!\nstate_new = fold(state_old, operation, [new_event])",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "OBxnR-FwA-RMq31XtyDa4",
      "originalText": "- Fold or reduce applies an operation cumulatively over a sequence. \nSomething like:\nSignature: fold(initial_value, operation, sequence)\n\nReturns: The accumulated result after applying operation to all elements\n\nSame operation applied incrementally!\nstate_new = fold(state_old, operation, [new_event])",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
