    {
      "id": "ls55U-o00JUge3xdgelbL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4039.2386286881697,
      "y": 1163.4230346377026,
      "width": 630.9395751953125,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1502124290,
      "version": 190,
      "versionNonce": 1740868354,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781464255499,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Formal Definition\n\nFor an AGGREGATION TO BE INCREMENTALLY COMPUTABLE\n there must exist a monoid M = (S, ⊕, e) where:\n\nM = {Set S, Binary Operation ⊕, Identity Element e}\n\nSuch that:\n\n1. CLOSURE: For all a, b ∈ S: a ⊕ b ∈ S\n   (Combining any two elements gives another element in the set)\n\n2. ASSOCIATIVITY: For all a, b, c ∈ S:\n   (a ⊕ b) ⊕ c = a ⊕ (b ⊕ c)\n   (Grouping doesn't matter)\n\n3. IDENTITY: There exists e ∈ S such that:\n   e ⊕ a = a and a ⊕ e = a for all a ∈ S\n   (Neutral element exists)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Formal Definition\n\nFor an AGGREGATION TO BE INCREMENTALLY COMPUTABLE\n there must exist a monoid M = (S, ⊕, e) where:\n\nM = {Set S, Binary Operation ⊕, Identity Element e}\n\nSuch that:\n\n1. CLOSURE: For all a, b ∈ S: a ⊕ b ∈ S\n   (Combining any two elements gives another element in the set)\n\n2. ASSOCIATIVITY: For all a, b, c ∈ S:\n   (a ⊕ b) ⊕ c = a ⊕ (b ⊕ c)\n   (Grouping doesn't matter)\n\n3. IDENTITY: There exists e ∈ S such that:\n   e ⊕ a = a and a ⊕ e = a for all a ∈ S\n   (Neutral element exists)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
